---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Life's Little Things">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 space-y-8 bg-background text-text">
    <header class="space-y-3">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-title font-bold text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg">This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and how we protect it.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you place an order or contact us, we may collect your name, email address, phone number, shipping address, order details, and any message you send through our forms.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use this information to process orders, communicate about purchases, arrange shipping, respond to questions, and maintain records for business and tax purposes.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Sharing</h2>
      <p>We may share information with payment processors, shipping carriers, and service providers that help us operate the store. We do not sell personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-title text-primary">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a class="text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:lltcrafts22@gmail.com">lltcrafts22@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>